WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.540
Have you ever wondered about the deepest&nbsp;
desire of SCP-537, the Singing Gramophone?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:12.320
Foundation Staff used SCP-978, the Desire&nbsp;
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-537 while it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:17.720
playing its record. This was the result:
"Seated on a log in a swamp, opposite Kermit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:23.060
the Frog; Kermit is holding a banjo as in the&nbsp;
opening musical sequence in The Muppet Movie."

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:29.960
It seems as if SCP-537 dreams of a star-studded&nbsp;
life entertaining people from the Silver Screen.

